OL,3,GNEWSAFirst publicly owned buses hit the
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first buses under public control in
OL,7,FMerseyside have hit the road in St
OL,8,FHelens.
OL,10,FThe Liverpool City Region Combined
OL,11,FAuthority (LCRCA) said the "rollout of
OL,12,Fthe first locally-run bus services" in
OL,13,Fthe area is the "biggest change to
OL,14,Fpublic transport in the region for more
OL,15,Fthan a generation".
OL,17,FA new X3 Express service service to
OL,18,FLiverpool John Lennon Airport has
OL,19,Fbegun, as well as an early morning
OL,20,Fexpress journey to Southport and an
OL,21,Fevening return.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
